    <h2>Our Commitment to Education & Social Impact</h2>
    <h3>eLearnKranti – An Initiative of UG Alliance Foundation</h3>

    <p>
      eLearnKranti is a digital learning and skilling platform developed as an educational initiative under its parent organisation, UG Alliance Foundation, a registered Non-Governmental Organisation (NGO) dedicated to education, skill development, and youth empowerment.
    </p>

    <p>
      While UG Alliance Foundation operates as a non-profit organisation, eLearnKranti functions as its education and skilling platform, designed to deliver structured, technology-enabled learning programs to students, professionals, educators, and institutions.
    </p>

    <h3>Our Purpose</h3>
    <p>
      eLearnKranti was created with a strong purpose aligned with the broader mission of UG Alliance Foundation — to strengthen learning outcomes and career readiness through digital education.
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>Bridging the gap between education and employability</li>
      <li>Making skill-based and career-oriented learning widely accessible</li>
      <li>Empowering students, educators, and working professionals through structured digital programs</li>
      <li>Providing a scalable platform for faculty, mentors, and trainers to share expertise</li>
      <li>Supporting nation-building through education, skills, and innovation</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      Every program on eLearnKranti is designed to create long-term educational and social value.
    </p>

    <h3>About UG Alliance Foundation (Parent Organisation)</h3>
    <p>
      UG Alliance Foundation is a registered NGO working across multiple social-impact domains, including:
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>Education & Digital Learning</li>
      <li>Skill Development & Youth Empowerment</li>
      <li>Awareness & Capacity Building</li>
      <li>Social Impact & Community Development</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      eLearnKranti operates as the education and skilling vertical of UG Alliance Foundation, supporting its vision of accessible, inclusive, and future-ready learning.
    </p>

    <h3>Transparency & Ethics</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Ethical and responsible educational practices</li>
      <li>Transparency in operations and partnerships</li>
      <li>Fair collaboration with educators, institutions, and partners</li>
      <li>Alignment with the values and objectives of our parent NGO</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      We believe that education is a powerful enabler, and digital platforms should be used to create opportunity, inclusion, and progress.
    </p>

    <h3>Legal & Organisational Note</h3>
    <p>
      eLearnKranti operates under the guidance and governance of UG Alliance Foundation (NGO) and adheres to all applicable laws, policies, and ethical standards relevant to education, skilling, and digital learning initiatives in India.
    </p>

    <p>
      eLearnKranti is an education and skilling platform developed under the aegis of UG Alliance Foundation (NGO).
